msgid ""
"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to create powerful connections "
"between your terms. When one term is added to a post, its linked terms can "
"be automatically added too. This helps maintain consistent organization "
"across your content."
msgstr ""
"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro omogućuje vam stvaranje snažnih veza između "
"vaših pojmova. Kada se jedan pojam doda u objavu, njegovi povezani pojmovi "
"također se mogu automatski dodati. To pomaže održavanju dosljedne "
"organizacije vašeg sadržaja."

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:658
msgid ""
"This feature allows you to associate additional words with each term. For "
"example, \"website\" can have synonyms such as \"websites\", \"web site\", "
"and \"web pages\"."
msgstr ""
"Ova značajka vam omogućuje da povežete dodatne riječi s svakim pojmom. Na "
"primjer, \"web stranica\" može imati sinonime poput \"web stranice\", \"web "
"site\" i \"web stranice\"."

